  "worked_solution": "First, we remove the first row and second column:\n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}\u2217 & -3a & \u2217 \\\\ -b & \u2217 & -2c \\\\ -a & \u2217 & b\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}-b & -2c \\\\ -a & b\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}-b & -2c \\\\ -a & b\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-b\\cdot b-(-2c)\\cdot (-a) \\\\  & =-{b}^{2}-2ac\\end{aligned}\n$$",
